{"step_index":535,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:51:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T17:51:16-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T17:51:19-06:00\nThe search for \"\"Pure fire of God\" \"purged from dross\" hymn\" returned the following summary:\nIt appears you are looking for one of two specific Christian hymns or songs that contain these themes.\n\n### 1. \"Spirit of Grace, Thou Light of Life\"\nThis hymn contains the exact phrase **\"Pure Fire of God\"** and the concept of being **\"purged from... dross\"**[1][2].\n\n*   **Key Lyrics:**\n    > \"Pure Fire of God, burn out my sin,\n    > Cleanse all the earthly dross from me;\n    > Refine my secret heart within,\n    > The golden streams of love set free!\"[1][2]\n\n### 2. \"A Vessel Unto Honour\" (by Julia Montoro)\nThis song is often used in worship and contains the phrase **\"purged from dross\"** in the context of being a vessel for God[3][4].\n\n*   **Key Lyrics:**\n    > \"Lord, my vessel is empty;\n    > It is purged from dross and sin,\n    > By your precious blood on Calv'ry.\n    > It has cleansed me now within.\"[3][4][5]\n\nSources:\n[1] [pcnnewhavenenugu.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXS2v-yuZO7utOtCwBHKGbFVN2jht8pv4PW_EbGabgq1NzT4ups4V_g2xLWXqRfMDnqx-Uv4WcAVSrecG91ebIIg26gEBR-4dnl8N0twsKmHiodUpz5KOYXqJCoo4=)\n[2] [pcnnewhavenenugu.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXS2v-yuZO7utOtCwBHKGbFVN2jht8pv4PW_EbGabgq1NzT4ups4V_g2xLWXqRfMDnqx-Uv4WcAVSrecG91ebIIg26gEBR-4dnl8N0twsKmHiodUpz5KOYXqJCoo4=)\n[3] [namethathymn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUOztmWbLRlwPfY6zBD4XWgJsRR9PhggIQQoTVih39eM41nkbXacSoNzbLAHqnOBhNHgq4Y3GXEyGoWs3sRPOVc_bR_EqYKuoIq2a6CLue0D8Lfr_eDPB-gyxrzMsyxx79GwFOu7HArDKLmZGsFw==)\n[4] [blogspot.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIb0OeXMi8wM0oPxMEop-Lv3SU40o-wj6iRwA9qIyXF0YaesTDVIC