{"step_index":542,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:51:38Z","thinking":"Analyzing audio around the prayer's estimated end time to pinpoint the precise moment music begins, identifying the transition from spoken word to Song 1. The goal is sub-second accuracy for cut boundaries, by examining the audio waveforms for the start of the music.\n\n\n\nPinpointing the conclusion of Song 1 involves analyzing the audio around the estimated endpoint, seeking the fade of music and onset of spoken word. The transition between Song 2's introduction (clapping) and the preceding spoken section will be analyzed to establish the boundaries. Examining the audio waveform to identify applause and the beginning of the worship leader's exhortation is essential.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Python script to analyze RMS energy and find exact sub-second cut boundaries\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import numpy as np\\nimport scipy.io.wavfile as wavfile\\n\\ndef format_tc(sec, fps=30):\\n    total_frames = int(round(sec * fps))\\n    f = total_frames % fps\\n    total_s = total_frames // fps\\n    s = total_s % 60\\n    total_m = total_s // 60\\n    m = total_m % 60\\n    h = total_m // 60\\n    return f\\\"{h:02d}:{m:02d}:{s:02d}:{f:02d}\\\"\\n\\nsr, data = wavfile.read(r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\djtwo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\july19_16k.wav\\\")\\ndata = data.astype(np.float32) / 32768.0\\n\\nranges_to_inspect = [\\n    (\\\"Opening Prayer -> Song 1 Intro\\\", 125, 155),        # 02:05 - 02:35\\n    (\\\"Song 1 Singing Start\\\", 145, 160),                  # 02:25 - 02:40\\n    (\\\"Song 1 End -> Speaking 1\\\", 315, 335),              # 05:15 - 05:35\\n    (\\\"Speaking 1 -> Song 2 Intro/Singing\\\", 370, 390),     # 06:10 - 06:30\\n    (\\\"Song 2 End -> Speaking 2\\\", 480, 500),              # 08:00 - 08:20\\n    (\\\"Speaking 2 -> Song 3 Intro/Singing\\\", 1235, 1260),   # 20:35 - 21:00\\n    (\\\"Song 3 End -> Speaking 3\\\", 1485, 1505),            # 24:45 - 25:05\\n    (\\\"Speaking 3 -> Song 4 Intro/Singing\\\", 1595, 1615),   # 26:35 - 26:55\\n    (\\\"Song 4 End -> Song 5 Intro/Singing\\\", 1820, 1845),   # 30:20 - 30:45\\n    (\\\"Song 5 End / Video End\\\", 2115, 2126),              # 35:15 - 35:26\\n]\\n\\nfor name, start_s, end_s in ranges_to_inspect:\\n    sub = data[int(start_s * sr):int(end_s * sr)]\\n    win = int(0.2 * sr) # 200ms window\\n    step = int(0.1 * sr) # 100ms step\\n    energies = []\\n    times = []\\n    for i in range(0, len(sub) - win, step):\\n        chunk = sub[i:i+win]\\n        rms = np.sqrt(np.mean(chunk**2))\\n        t = start_s + i / sr\\n        energies.append(rms)\\n        times.append(t)\\n    \\n    print(f\\\"\\\\n=== {name} ===\\\")\\n    # Print every 2nd or 3rd point or where energy shifts\\n    for t, e in zip(times[::2], energies[::2]):\\n        m, s = divmod(int(t), 60)\\n        ms = int((t % 1) * 100)\\n        rms_db = 20 * np.log10(e + 1e-6)\\n        print(f\\\"  {m:02d}:{s:02d}.{ms:02d} (frame {int(round(t*30))}, tc {format_tc(t)}): {rms_db:5.1\n<truncated 11 bytes>","Description":"\"Audio energy analysis for July 19 Praise Live cuts\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\djtwo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\56930dde-d49e-4d64-b3a0-ddf3ad4cb3e8\\\\scratch\\\\refine_july19_cuts.py\"","toolAction":"\"Write audio energy refinement script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write audio energy refinement script\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
