{"step_index":593,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:53:44Z","content":"I have analyzed **`RLCF Praise Live — July 19, 2026.mp4`**, transcribed the audio, identified all **5 worship songs** along with each speaking and prayer segment, and created the 1-click DaVinci Resolve scripts for you.\n\n---\n\n### 🎵 Identified Songs in the File\n\n| # | Song Title | Start Time | End Time | Duration | Lyrics / Key Themes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **1** | **What a Faithful God Have I** | `02:11` | `05:19` | 3m 08s | *\"Lord I come before Your throne of grace... What a faithful God have I...\"* |\n| **2** | **Why So Downcast, O My Soul** | `06:14` | `08:09` | 1m 55s | *\"Why so downcast O my soul, put your hope in God... Bless the Lord O my soul... He's the lifter of my countenance...\"* |\n| **3** | **Burn, Fire of God!** *(My Ransomed Soul Possessing)* | `20:48` | `24:56` | 4m 08s | *\"Burn, fire of God, my ransomed soul possessing... Touch with live coal from off Thy sacred altar... Pure fire of God...\"* |\n| **4** | **Christ Is Mine Forevermore** | `26:43` | `30:37` | 3m 54s | *\"Mine are days that God has numbered... Mine are tears in times of sorrow... Pilgrim on the narrow way... Christ is mine forevermore!\"* |\n| **5** | **Footprints of Jesus** *(Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)* | `30:37` | `35:26` | 4m 49s | *\"Sweetly Lord have we heard Thee calling, 'Come, follow Me!'... Footprints of Jesus that make the pathway glow...\"* |\n\n---\n\n### 🎬 Complete Timeline Breakdown (Full Service)\n\nEvery section is cut with sub-second accuracy to preserve full musical introductions and natural reverb decay:\n\n| Clip | Section Name | Type | Start Timecode | End Timecode | Color Code |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Opening Spoken Prayer** | Spoken | `00:00:00:00` | `00:02:11:00` | **Orange** |\n| 2 | **1. What a Faithful God Have I** | **Song** | `00:02:11:00` | `00:05:19:03` | **Teal** |\n| 3 | **Sharing: Encourage Yourself in the Lord** | Spoken | `00:05:19:03` | `00:06:14:15` | **Orange** |\n| 4 | **2. Why So Downcast, O My Soul** | **Song** | `00:06:14:15` | `00:08:09:15` | **Teal** |\n| 5 | **Pray\n<truncated 543 bytes>\nnerated and installed **two** scripts directly into DaVinci Resolve:\